1. Parameter descriptions
-------------------------

The description text in the parameter schema
(sicopr_assist/data/sicopr_param_schema.csv) is taken from comments in the
IEEE 802.3 COM Reference Code (com_ieee8023_*.m) and from the keywords sheet of
the COM workbooks.

